---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import academic from '../data/academic.json';
import {site, localUrl} from '../config';
---
<Layout title="Teaching" description="Undergraduate and graduate teaching, educational interests, and research mentorship of Grant Benham.">
  <div class="container page-content">
    <PageHeading title="Teaching" eyebrow="Learning & mentorship" />
    <section class="prose"><h2>Educational interests</h2><p>Grant Benham’s teaching interests include active learning, student engagement, online education, and the integration of research into the curriculum. His teaching presentations have addressed student-generated digital media projects, classroom response technologies, and community engagement.</p><p>Recent professional development documented in his CV includes generative AI in education and course design, as well as training in research mentorship. His work has been recognized with awards for online teaching, mentoring, and faculty advising.</p></section>
    <div class="two-columns content-section"><section><h2>Undergraduate teaching</h2><ul class="course-list">{academic.undergraduateCourses.map(course => <li>{course}</li>)}</ul></section><section><h2>Graduate teaching</h2><ul class="course-list">{academic.graduateCourses.map(course => <li>{course}</li>)}</ul></section></div>
    <section class="content-section prose"><h2>Graduate mentorship</h2><p>Research mentorship connects students with questions about psychological stress, sleep, health, and individual differences. Collaborative publications and presentations document students’ involvement in this work.</p><p>Prospective mentees can contact Grant Benham with their research interests to inquire about supervision and current opportunities.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Discuss research interests →</a><a class="text-link" href={localUrl('/lab/')}>About the lab →</a></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
